TEXT 1960 -856 Left 2 !*\n.PARAM Fline=50\n.param Vgrms=120\n.PARAM Vgpeak={Vgrms*sqrt(2)}\n.PARAM Vamp={Vgpeak*2}\n.MODEL TOFSW SW(Ron=25m Roff=10Meg Vt=2 Vh=1)\n.MODEL TOFD D(IS=10e-18 RS=16m CJO=500p \n+M=0.4 VJ=0.75 ISR=720n BV=1000 IBV=100u TT=130n)\n*
TEXT 1960 -1000 Left 2 !.tran 0 300m 200m uic
